Package: runloki365
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1
Maintainer: mohamedEmad23
Description: Animated system monitor for Linux
 RunLoki365 is a lightweight system monitor that displays an animated
 character in your system tray. The animation speed adapts to CPU usage,
 providing a fun and visual way to monitor your system.
 .
 Features:
  - Real-time CPU, memory, and storage monitoring
  - Animated tray icon (Tux, Cat, Parrot)
  - Automatic theme detection (light/dark)
  - Customizable FPS limit
  - Launch at startup option
  - Low resource usage
Homepage: https://github.com/mohamedEmad23/RunLoki365
Installed-Size: 75656
